## 2. What kind of app this is

This is a **single-page browser web app**, not a Node server UI:

- **Build**: [Vite](https://vitejs.dev/) (`npm run dev` on `127.0.0.1:8001`, `npm run build` → `dist/`).
- **UI**: [React 19](https://react.dev/) mounting from `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/main.jsx`.
- **Auxiliary CLIs**: Node scripts under `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/scripts/` (`extract-audio.mjs`, `download-youtube.mjs`) — developer utilities, not the main app bundle.

Purpose (from README and code): **Muse Transcribe** — slow down / loop / mark audio for transcription; local files or YouTube.

