## 3. Music / audio playback–related code

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| **Hook / engine** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/hooks/useAudioPlayer.js` | `HTMLAudioElement`, Web Audio gain, SoundTouchJS `PitchShifter` for decoded buffers, YouTube iframe player, tempo/pitch/loop/seek/play-pause |
| **Decode / context** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/utils/audioBuffer.js` | Singleton `AudioContext`, `decodeAudioFile`, `formatTime` / `formatPreciseTime` |
| **Waveform** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/components/WaveformCanvas.jsx` | Reads `audioBuffer.getChannelData(0)` and draws waveform on `<canvas>` |
| **YouTube** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/components/YouTubePlayer.jsx` | `YT.Player` embed; notifies parent via `onPlayerReady` |
| **YouTube utils** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/utils/youtube.js` | `getYouTubeVideoId`, async `loadYouTubeIframeApi` |
| **App wiring** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/App.jsx` | `decodeAudioFile` + `player.load(blobUrl, buffer)` vs `player.loadYouTube(id)`; selection → `player.setLoopRange` |
| **Offline extract** | `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/scripts/extract-audio.mjs` | `ffmpeg` to strip audio from video |

**Important behavior distinctions** (from `useAudioPlayer.js`):

- **Local files**: Decode to `AudioBuffer` → playback via SoundTouch pitch shifter (connect/disconnect toggles play for buffer path).
- **YouTube**: No decoded buffer (`audioBuffer` is `null` in `App`); iframe player drives time; tempo via `setPlaybackRate`; pitch shifting is disabled in UI when `sourceType !== "audio"` (`PitchControl.jsx`).
- Global **keyboard** handling in `useAudioPlayer`: Space play/pause, R restart, arrows seek ±5/10s (`useAudioPlayer.js` ~329–361). `App.jsx` adds `M`, `F`, `S`, `E` for markers and selection jumps.

