**Playback / transport**

- **`Transport.jsx`** — Primary playback UI: large **play/pause** (`PlayIcon` / `PauseIcon`), time badge, **File Start / Selection Start / Selection End** buttons, **settings** button (visual only — no handler wired in the snippet):

