- **`Player.jsx`** — **Zoom − / +**, **fit track**, **fullscreen**; wraps `Timeline` + `Transport`.
- **`ControlPanel.jsx`** — **Add Mark**, **Add Loop**, per-item **Remove**, clickable cards for marks/loops.
- **`Header.jsx`** — **Choose Audio**, **Choose YouTube**, GitHub link.
- **`Landing.jsx`** — Card-style **`role="button"`** areas + nested **Choose File** / **Enter YouTube Link** buttons.

**Non-button interaction**

- **`Timeline.jsx`** + **`SelectionOverlay.jsx`** — drag selection on canvas overlay; **`MarkerOverlay.jsx`** — mark visualization.
- **`TimeTicks.jsx`** — time ruler (no playback by itself).

**Icons** — `/Users/eliaweiss/work/trasncribe/src/components/Icons.jsx` defines `PlayIcon`, `PauseIcon`, and controls icons used above.

