### Summary

The repo is a **Vite + React SPA** (“Muse Transcribe”) for **browser-based transcription practice**: waveform from **Web Audio–decoded** buffers, **SoundTouchJS** for time-stretch/pitch on files, **YouTube IFrame API** for video sources, plus **markers, loops, speed, zoom**, and **CLI helpers** (`scripts/`) outside the SPA. Playback controls concentrate in **`Transport.jsx`** (play/pause), **`SpeedControl.jsx`**, **`PitchControl.jsx`**, and keyboard logic in **`useAudioPlayer.js`**.
